WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:09.780
My partner, a used Centaur rocket stage, hit Cabeus crater first.

2
00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:20.510
I flew straight through the cloud it kicked up, sniffing and photographing, and sent everything home. Four minutes later I crashed too.

3
00:00:21.210 --> 00:00:26.430
We found water — frozen in the dark for perhaps billions of years.

4
00:00:27.130 --> 00:00:31.800
I watched my own rocket hit the Moon, then followed it down.
